  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Anti-Corruption Tunisia 2013 - 2014 - UNDP anti-corruption Tunisia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP anti-korruption Tunisien 2013 - 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d genom UNDP till en tunisisk nationell anti-korruptionsmekanism   med fokus p&#xe5; &#xf6;kad transparens, redovisningsansvar och demokratisk     samh&#xe4;llsstyrning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through UNDP to the establishment of a national anti          corruption mechanism in Tunisia focusing on transparency,             accountability and democratic governanvence.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support the establishment of a National Integrity System in Tunisia through focusing on&#xa0;four main objectives/result areas;
1.&#xa0;Development of&#xa0;a national anti-corruption strategy and action plan.
2. Establishment of&#xa0;a Tunisian Anti-Corruption Agency.
3. Development of diagnostic reports on the existing anti-corruption legal frames.
4.&#xa0;Institutionalization of knowledge about anti-corruption,&#xa0;transparency and accountability.
5. Increase of public awareness of anti-corruption, transparency and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
